#: 0bddcc9c3d414bc6a93158e4cb9e7c44
msgid ""
"The large number of possible combinations of template (Fedora 37, 38; Debian "
"10, 11) and browser (multiple Google Chrome versions, multiple Chromium "
"versions, multiple Firefox versions) made it impractical for us to test "
"every combination that users are likely to attempt with the Qubes CTAP "
